{"id":"e29ed1961d4b73a9","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-feasible-mathematics.md","title":"Feasible Mathematics","display":"df-feasible-mathematics — Feasible Mathematics","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-feasible-mathematics","aliases":["92-df-feasible-mathematics"],"display":"df-feasible-mathematics — Feasible Mathematics","depends_on":["[[92-df-pv-function]]","[[92-df-proof-predicate]]"],"source":"原书之外的集合层级、可行计算或序数背景；未把这些条目归入该 PDF 的章节内容","source_status":"外部背景定义"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-feasible-mathematics"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-feasible-mathematics</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-feasible-mathematics — Feasible Mathematics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3421dd0a360a650\" href=\"?note=a3421dd0a360a650\" title=\"92-df-pv-function\">92-df-pv-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7e21e34fc6bec397\" href=\"?note=7e21e34fc6bec397\" title=\"92-df-proof-predicate\">92-df-proof-predicate</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"原书之外的集合层级、可行计算或序数背景；未把这些条目归入该 PDF 的章节内容"},{"key":"source_status","html":"外部背景定义"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PV}\">\\(\\mathrm{PV}\\)</span> (polynomial-time function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a3421dd0a360a650\" href=\"?note=a3421dd0a360a650\" title=\"92-df-pv-function\">92-df-pv-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prf}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Prf}_G\\)</span> (coded proof relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7e21e34fc6bec397\" href=\"?note=7e21e34fc6bec397\" title=\"92-df-proof-predicate\">92-df-proof-predicate</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FeasibleProof}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{FeasibleProof}_G\\)</span> (definition-target feasible-proof-verification predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}feasible\\text{-}mathematics} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{FeasibleProof}_G\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists V:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\{0,1\\}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{PV}(V)\\land\n\\forall k,m\\in\\mathbb N\\;(V(k,m)=1\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Prf}_G(k,m))\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}feasible\\text{-}mathematics} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{FeasibleProof}_G\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists V:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\{0,1\\}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{PV}(V)\\land\n\\forall k,m\\in\\mathbb N\\;(V(k,m)=1\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Prf}_G(k,m))\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>该性质只断言在<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a3421dd0a360a650\" href=\"?note=a3421dd0a360a650\" title=\"92-df-pv-function\">92-df-pv-function</a>固定的机器模型、二进制输入长度和当前证明编码下，证明关系有多项式时间判定器</li>\n<li>它不声称所有证明长度有统一上界，也不声称寻找证明是多项式时间的</li>\n<li>素数幂等数值编码在位复杂度下是否支持所需多项式时间解码必须单独验证；换用显式字符串/序列证书时也要重新固定编码</li>\n<li>有界算术研究可行数学</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^1_2\">\\(S^1_2\\)</span>与可行推理的精确联系取决于语言、可定义性和可证明全函数等口径，不能仅由本谓词定义推出</li>\n<li>不完备性在可行数学中的版本</li>\n<li>证明复杂度研究</li>\n<li>实际算法限制</li>\n<li>P vs NP的影响</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-pv-function","status":"resolved","id":"a3421dd0a360a650","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-pv-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-proof-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"7e21e34fc6bec397","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-proof-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-pv-function","status":"resolved","id":"a3421dd0a360a650","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PV}$ (polynomial-time function predicate, see [[92-df-pv-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-proof-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"7e21e34fc6bec397","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Prf}_G$ (coded proof relation, see [[92-df-proof-predicate]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-pv-function","status":"resolved","id":"a3421dd0a360a650","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"该性质只断言在[[92-df-pv-function]]固定的机器模型、二进制输入长度和当前证明编码下，证明关系有多项式时间判定器","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{PV}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prf}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FeasibleProof}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}feasible\\text{-}mathematics} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{FeasibleProof}_G\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists V:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\{0,1\\}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{PV}(V)\\land\n\\forall k,m\\in\\mathbb N\\;(V(k,m)=1\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Prf}_G(k,m))\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"S^1_2","display":false}],"bytes":1722,"backlinks":[{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-58","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-feasible-mathematics]]"}],"outgoing":["a3421dd0a360a650","7e21e34fc6bec397"]}